INSERT INTO "news" ("id","title","summary","url","kind","category","published_at","first_seen_at","updated_at","image","extra") VALUES('b2389633','The WoW Forever Beta Celebration is Underway','The WoW Forever Beta will end 24 hours from now, at 10:00 a.m. PDT on Friday, October 23, and until that fateful moment, we’re celebrating the joy and wonder of WoW Forever with 24 hours of shenanigans and upheaval in Zephras Isle, Dun Morogh, Elwynn Forest, Teldrassil, Durotar, Tirisfal Glades, and…','https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/the-wow-forever-beta-celebration-is-underway/2389633','blue','官方論壇',1792688400,1792689356,1793030455,'','[{"n":1,"at":1792688400,"user":"Kaivax","text":"The WoW Forever Beta will end 24 hours from now, at 10:00 a.m. PDT on Friday, October 23, and until that fateful moment, we’re celebrating the joy and wonder of WoW Forever with 24 hours of shenanigans and upheaval in Zephras Isle, Dun Morogh, Elwynn Forest, Teldrassil, Durotar, Tirisfal Glades, and…","url":"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/the-wow-forever-beta-celebration-is-underway/2389633/1"}]');
INSERT INTO "news" ("id","title","summary","url","kind","category","published_at","first_seen_at","updated_at","image","extra") VALUES('b2389801','Beta Realm Restart Today At 2:00 p.m. PDT','In about 40 minutes, at 2:00 p.m. PDT (4:00 p.m. CDT, 5:00 p.m. EDT), we will quickly restart the WoW Forever Beta. Players who are currently in game will receive messages from our server team warning them of the restart, beginning 15 minutes before the Beta goes offline. See you on the other side…','https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/beta-realm-restart-today-at-200-pm-pdt/2389801','blue','官方論壇',1792700398,1792701055,1793030455,'','[{"n":1,"at":1792700398,"user":"Kaivax","text":"In about 40 minutes, at 2:00 p.m. PDT (4:00 p.m. CDT, 5:00 p.m. EDT), we will quickly restart the WoW Forever Beta. Players who are currently in game will receive messages from our server team warning them of the restart, beginning 15 minutes before the Beta goes offline. See you on the other side…","url":"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/beta-realm-restart-today-at-200-pm-pdt/2389801/1"}]');
INSERT INTO "news" ("id","title","summary","url","kind","category","published_at","first_seen_at","updated_at","image","extra") VALUES('24302577','深入探索 Beta 測試完結特輯！','在本集《魔獸世界：永恆》Podcast 中，主持人 Countdown To Classic、特別來賓 Meeix、資深遊戲設計師 Josh "Aggrend" Greenfield、製作副總監 Clay Stone、首席軟體工程師 Ana Resendez，以及首席遭遇戰設計師 Michael Nuthals 齊聚一堂，為我們帶來特別的一集。','https://news.blizzard.com/zh-tw/article/24302577/beta','off','最新消息',1792685700,1792738855,1793030455,'https://bnetcmsus-a.akamaihd.net/cms/blog_thumbnail/4y/4Y53KWDX3L421792624938050.png','');
INSERT INTO "news" ("id","title","summary","url","kind","category","published_at","first_seen_at","updated_at","image","extra") VALUES('24302070','在《魔獸世界：永恆》中選擇你的規則','《魔獸世界：永恆》採用全新手段，讓玩家決定展開旅程的地點與方式。玩家不需要在落落長的伺服器列表中選擇，而是選擇你想如何體驗艾澤拉斯的規則：普通、PvP、角色扮演，或是專家模式。每個選項中的組隊、地城、團隊副本與社群都以獨立大型生態系統運作，專家模式則將於遊戲正式推出一段時間後加入可用選項當中。','https://news.blizzard.com/zh-tw/article/24302070/%E5%9C%A8%E3%80%8A%E9%AD%94%E7%8D%B8%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%EF%BC%9A%E6%B0%B8%E6%81%86%E3%80%8B%E4%B8%AD%E9%81%B8%E6%93%87%E4%BD%A0%E7%9A%84%E8%A6%8F%E5%89%87','off','最新消息',1792683843,1792738855,1793030455,'https://bnetcmsus-a.akamaihd.net/cms/blog_header/1p/1PD2ZLVROZOB1789961389530.png','');
INSERT INTO "news" ("id","title","summary","url","kind","category","published_at","first_seen_at","updated_at","image","extra") VALUES('b2390465','Thank You For Testing the WoW Forever Beta','The WoW Forever Beta is now closed, and we’re incredibly grateful to everyone who joined us over the last five weeks of playtesting, data gathering, bug reporting, and feedback. We’re now quickly moving into a period of a few short days where we will do some focused work on priority issues and the …','https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/thank-you-for-testing-the-wow-forever-beta/2390465','blue','官方論壇',1792774841,1792774856,1793030455,'','[{"n":1,"at":1792774841,"user":"Kaivax","text":"The WoW Forever Beta is now closed, and we’re incredibly grateful to everyone who joined us over the last five weeks of playtesting, data gathering, bug reporting, and feedback. We’re now quickly moving into a period of a few short days where we will do some focused work on priority issues and the …","url":"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/thank-you-for-testing-the-wow-forever-beta/2390465/1"}]');
INSERT INTO "news" ("id","title","summary","url","kind","category","published_at","first_seen_at","updated_at","image","extra") VALUES('beta-timewalking','《魔獸世界：永恆》封測個人數據查詢：暴雪「時光漫遊」網頁','有玩封測的話，到暴雪的「時光漫遊」（Beta Timewalking）網頁用戰網帳號登入，就能看你在封測的遊戲時長、玩了幾隻角色，和你排在所有玩家的第幾百分位。不含壓力測試。','/news/beta-timewalking','off','本站整理',1792773600,1792774856,1793030455,'','');
INSERT INTO "news" ("id","title","summary","url","kind","category","published_at","first_seen_at","updated_at","image","extra") VALUES('24313106','本週《魔獸世界》新聞：深入了解《魔獸世界：永恆》、諸神之地祖阿曼、萬鬼節，與超多精彩內容','從《魔獸世界：永恆》的最新消息，到《燃燒的遠征》經典週年紀念版推出的諸神之地祖阿曼內容更新，本週新聞帶來最新資訊、詭譎的遊戲內活動、全新獎勵，以及遍布艾澤拉斯、等待你探索的冒險。','https://news.blizzard.com/zh-tw/article/24313106/%E6%9C%AC%E9%80%B1%E3%80%8A%E9%AD%94%E7%8D%B8%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E3%80%8B%E6%96%B0%E8%81%9E%EF%BC%9A%E6%B7%B1%E5%85%A5%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E3%80%8A%E9%AD%94%E7%8D%B8%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%EF%BC%9A%E6%B0%B8%E6%81%86%E3%80%8B%E3%80%81%E8%AB%B8%E7%A5%9E%E4%B9%8B%E5%9C%B0%E7%A5%96%E9%98%BF%E6%9B%BC%E3%80%81%E8%90%AC%E9%AC%BC%E7%AF%80%EF%BC%8C%E8%88%87%E8%B6%85%E5%A4%9A%E7%B2%BE%E5%BD%A9%E5%85%A7%E5%AE%B9','off','最新消息',1792774860,1792775757,1793030455,'https://bnetcmsus-a.akamaihd.net/cms/blog_thumbnail/ql/QLOIU1ZTOZDM1792707132502.png','');
